# k.actions/shards/verbs-send: 21 verbs and phrasal verbs that mean the act "send" (send, send out, send off, mail, post, e-mail, email, forward ...): the WordNet senses read for it, the role of the object, what the verb itself says, and the prepositions that mark a role after this verb.
# sources: wordnet 3.1 (Princeton WordNet 3.1: the verb, its sense numbers and the gloss of 19 verbs; which act a sense means and the roles are a language model's reading, named=model)
# sources: hand-core 1 (hand-written in this repository: 2 verbs that WordNet does not list in this meaning, and the markings; sources/hand-core/act-verbs.tsv)
# license: WordNet-3.0
# script: tools/acts-core.mjs

@k.actions.verb.send.send k.actions.verb text=send act=send sense=2 sense=3 gloss="to cause or order to be taken, directed, or transmitted to another place" object=thing named=model core.source="wordnet 3.1"
@k.actions.verb.send.send_out k.actions.verb text="send out" act=send sense=1 gloss="to cause or order to be taken, directed, or transmitted to another place" object=thing separable=true named=model core.source="wordnet 3.1"
